{"id":6255,"date":"2026-07-08T10:30:00","date_gmt":"2026-07-08T09:30:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.jouwweb.nl\/blog\/?p=6255"},"modified":"2026-06-03T13:35:37","modified_gmt":"2026-06-03T12:35:37","slug":"tiktok-shop-a-gold-mine-or-a-risk-for-your-online-store","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.webador.com\/blog\/tiktok-shop-a-gold-mine-or-a-risk-for-your-online-store\/","title":{"rendered":"TikTok Shop: A Gold Mine or a Risk for Your Online Store?"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">TikTok Shop is growing for users around the world. With TikTok Shop, users are able to purchase and pay for products directly from a video or livestream, without having to leave the app.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">For some, it\u2019s the revolution of the year; for others, an exciting new playing field. What does the arrival of TikTok Shop mean for you as a new entrepreneur? And how can you adapt your online store to this trend? In this blog, we\u2019ll walk you through it and explain everything!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:80px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The opportunities<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The biggest advantage of TikTok Shop is that you don\u2019t have to start from scratch. Your products are immediately shown to an audience that actively uses the platform and is interested in this type of video. The barrier between discovery and purchase has never been lower: see a cool gadget or trendy outfit? Just tap the product tag and it\u2019s already ordered!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The downside<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Although the reach is appealing, TikTok Shop also comes with strict regulations and costs:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>The commission: Of course, TikTok doesn\u2019t offer this for free. The platform commission in Europe and the UK has been 9%. In America it is around 6%. That\u2019s a significant chunk of your profit margin.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Quick turnaround: TikTok\u2019s algorithm can reward you with thousands of orders today and ignore you tomorrow. Can your logistics handle that sudden spike in orders? TikTok penalizes online stores that deliver late or make administrative errors!<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:80px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What about Webador and TikTok Shop?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At this time, we don\u2019t have a direct, built-in integration with TikTok Shop. TikTok often requires a platform that uses a public API to synchronize products and inventory in real time for an official live integration.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Fortunately, that doesn\u2019t mean you can\u2019t do anything about it! If you use Webador, there are still two smart ways you can capitalize on the TikTok hype:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Method 1: The Link-in-Bio<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Instead of letting users check out directly within the TikTok app, you redirect them to your own online store.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Business Account<\/strong>: Switch to a TikTok Business account for free. This allows you to include a clickable link to your website in your bio.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Call-to-Action:<\/strong> Create videos about your products and always end with a call-to-action. For example: \u201cClick the link in my bio to order.\u201d<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:40px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Method 2: Selling manually through TikTok Seller Center<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Are you eager to use TikTok Shop? If so, you can manually create a shop through the TikTok Seller Center.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Manual entry:<\/strong> You manually enter your current products, images, and prices on the TikTok platform.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Keep an eye on your inventory<\/strong>: Since there is no automatic integration, your inventory will not sync. If you sell something on TikTok, you must manually update the inventory in your Webador online store!<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:80px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Opportunity or Risk?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Is TikTok Shop a goldmine? Or more of an e-commerce pitfall? The answer is probably somewhere in between.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">By using TikTok to create content and direct visitors to your own website via your bio, you can expand your reach without having to deal with the platform\u2019s associated costs.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-light-gray-background-color has-background\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-not-stacked-on-mobile is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"maak-nu-jouw-website-met-jouwweb\">Build your website with Webador today!<\/h3>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:30%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-right is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-89b4c9e9 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button alignright\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"\/?utm_source=jouwweb-blog&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=cta-blok#signup-modal\